OL,3,CProgramme listings for SUN 10 MAY
OL,4,G1900FThe Kershaw Tapes
OL,5,     GAndy Kershaw introduces his own
OL,6,     Gcassette recordings of music from
OL,7,     Ghis travels in Africa during the
OL,8,     G1980s.
OL,9,G1945FWords and Music
OL,10,     GPoets and composers often in
OL,11,     Gtheir work help us to pay
OL,12,     Gattention and notice the
OL,13,     Goverlooked. In our spotlight
OL,14,     Gtoday: ideas from Walt Whitman,
OL,15,     GDavid Foster Wallace, and Audre
OL,16,     GLorde.
